style="left:97%;top:50%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>A request does not hold the car. The car is booked only once you approve the offer, sign and pay.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-send-your-request" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Send your request</h2><p class="gd-p">The request has five short steps. Your answers are saved as you go, so you can come back.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Step 1, Dates and delivery: check the car and tap your dates in the calendar.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Set the Pickup time and Return time. Any time, day or night, with at least 2 hours of notice.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Your request, on the right, shows the estimated total as you go.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/1002"><img src="/guides/img/public-04-book-1-trip-desktop-63a3738b.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="1002"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:9.2%;top:67.1%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:15.3%;top:91%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:91.1%;top:54.7%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="4"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Choose where you get the car: <b class="gd-ui">At our location</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Deliver it to an address</b> or <b class="gd-ui">At the airport</b>. Then choose where you return it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to driver details</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/942"><img src="/guides/img/public-04-book-1-trip-desktop-befba4f6.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="942"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:5.3%;top:26.2%" aria-hidden="true">4</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:61.8%;top:93.3%" aria-hidden="true">5</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="6"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Step 2, The driver: fill in your first and last name, email, mobile number and date of birth.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div class="gd-t">Someone else will drive too? Add them under Additional drivers. Each needs a G2 or G licence and signs the agreement.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">8</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to licence</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:980/1032"><img src="/guides/img/public-05-book-2-driver-desktop-7b572499.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="980" height="1032"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:30.6%;top:21.1%" aria-hidden="true">6</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:30.6%;top:64.8%" aria-hidden="true">7</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:55.6%;top:88%" aria-hidden="true">8</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="9"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">9</span><div class="gd-t">Step 3: choose your Licence class, for example Ontario G2.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">10</span><div class="gd-t">Choose how the car is covered: Option 1 (OPCF 27 on your own auto policy), Option 2 (rental coverage on your credit card) or Option 3 (the CarmaCars Protection Plan). You can change this any time before pickup. You may also see a link to RentalCoverage, a separate company&#39;s optional product. It is not issued or handled by CarmaCars and does not replace the option you choose here, and we may earn a commission if you buy it, at no extra cost to you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">11</span><div class="gd-t">Choose the Booking type: Standard, or Non-refundable for 10% off with no refund.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">12</span><div class="gd-t">Add anything we should know in the notes, for example a flight number. If a body shop, a tow company or a friend sent you, type their name or the referral code from their card in Did someone refer you?.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">13</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Continue to add-ons</b>. Step 4, Add-ons: tick what you want (see Add-ons below), then press <b class="gd-ui">Review request</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/1452"><img src="/guides/img/public-06-book-3-licence-desktop-22bb144e.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="1452"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:61.8%;top:11.2%" aria-hidden="true">9</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:32.2%" aria-hidden="true">10</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:50.4%" aria-hidden="true">11</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:66.9%" aria-hidden="true">12</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:71.7%;top:97%" aria-hidden="true">13</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="14"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">14</span><div class="gd-t">Step 5, Check it and send: read every line. Use Edit beside a line to change it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">15</span><div class="gd-t">Tick the box to confirm you are 18 or older and agree to the Terms of use and Privacy policy.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">16</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send request</b>. Nothing is charged and no card is needed.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/book/2015-cadillac-cts-luxury?from=2026-12-04&amp;to=2026-12-07&amp;tf=10:00&amp;tt=10:00</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:760/492"><img src="/guides/img/public-07-book-4-review-desktop-005f4c0b.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="760" height="492"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.1%;top:24.8%" aria-hidden="true">14</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3.9%;top:59.3%" aria-hidden="true">15</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:73.7%;top:89%" aria-hidden="true">16</span></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol" start="17"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">17</span><div class="gd-t">The confirmation shows your request number, for example CC-10021. Keep it for any question.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">18</span><div class="gd-t">A person checks the calendar, your dates and your place, usually within 2 hours, day or night. Your offer arrives by email and in Trips.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/755"><img src="/guides/img/public-08-book-5-sent-phone-14a99ccf.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="755"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:32.8%;top:12.3%" aria-hidden="true">17</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-upload-your-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Upload your licence</h2><p class="gd-p">Right after you send your request: the front and back of your licence and a selfie holding it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the Request sent page, press <b class="gd-ui">Upload your licence</b> (or open your booking and press <b class="gd-ui">Your licence</b>).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Take each photo with your phone, or choose it. Add the licence number and expiry date if we ask: it must be valid after your return.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Rented with us before? A licence on file that is still valid is used again; nothing to upload.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>You need your licence on file to accept the offer.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-add-ons" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Add-ons</h2><p class="gd-p">Extras for your trip, such as a baby seat, a child or booster seat, flowers waiting in the car, a chauffeur, an umbrella, a phone charger or a full tank of gas.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the car page (under Add-ons) or in step 4 of the request, tick an add-on or use + and − for seats. The estimate shows the price at once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Each add-on shows its price: a trip, a day (with the most for a trip) or an hour. HST is added.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Some need notice, for example flowers need 24 hours. Seats and other items show how many are left for your dates.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A chauffeur is confirmed by our team in your offer.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">With a full tank of gas (prepaid) you can return the car at any fuel level, with no fuel charge.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-a-discount-code" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">A discount code</h2><p class="gd-p">A code from a game on the site, an offer we sent you, or from our team.</p><ul class="gd-ul"><li>On the last step of your request, type it in the promo code box. The price shows the discount at once.</li><li>Every code has a last day. You find it in the email or text that brought the code, and under Your discount codes on Your trips.</li><li>If you have not used a code, we remind you 3 days before its last day and the day before, by email and text as you chose in Profile. A code you won in a game is always reminded; a reminder of an offer comes only if you agreed to get offers, and every email has an Unsubscribe link.</li><li>A code that ended is refused with &quot;This code has expired&quot;. You can still send the request without it.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-ask-in-the-chat" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Ask in the chat</h2><p class="gd-p">The chat button sits in the corner of every page.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Press it and write your question: a car, your dates, the price, how booking works. The CarmaCars assistant answers right away with prices from our booking system.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Want a person? Press <b class="gd-ui">Talk to a person</b>. When our team is away, leave your name and email or phone with <b class="gd-ui">Send my details</b> and tick &quot;Email me a copy of this chat&quot;.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">End chat</b> when you are done. If you gave your email, a copy of the chat arrives by email.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">A price in the chat is for the dates you asked. Nothing is booked until you approve an offer, sign and pay.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="find-a-car-and-send-a-request-carry-on-later" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Carry on later</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Your name, email and mobile number are saved as you type them, so nothing is lost if you stop. We open an account for you with that email.</li><li>Every form that saves as you type says so under it: &quot;Saved as you type so you can pick up where you left off.&quot;, with a link to the privacy policy.</li><li>On the same phone or computer, open <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/account</span> (or the request page again) to carry on, no password needed.</li><li>We send you one email, &quot;Continue your request&quot;. One tap signs you in, confirms your email and opens your request on any device. You need it before you can accept an offer, sign or pay.</li><li>Already have an account? The form says &quot;You have an account: we sent you a sign-in link&quot;.</li></ul></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('renter', 'your-offer', 'chapter', 'find-a-car-and-send-a-request', 'Our offer is the confirmed price for your car and dates, with every fee and HST. It stays open for 24 hours. You approve it, ask for a change or decline it.

## Open your offer

1. We email you when the offer is ready. Sign in at `carmacars.ca/sign-in` and open **Trips**.
2. Your next trip is at the top, with a photo of the car and its next step. Press **Review offer**.

![](/guides/img/renter-02-trips-offer-desktop-27603c14.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 760; address: carmacars.ca/account; pins: 1 4.5 27.0, 2 11.5 70.0")

## Approve, ask for a change, or decline

1. Check the price, the dates, the place and any message from our team. The black bar shows how long the offer stays open.
2. All good? Press **Approve and continue** to sign and pay. No licence on file yet? The button says **Upload your licence to accept**: upload it, then come back.
3. Want something different? Press **Ask for a change**, write what you need, then **Send request**.
4. Not going ahead? Press **Decline offer**, then **Decline this offer**.

![](/guides/img/renter-03-offer-desktop-cae88b00.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 902; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10057/offer; pins: 1 86.1 12.0, 2 70.8 50.9, 3 70.8 58.1, 4 77.1 64.5")

> Watch out: This offer does not hold the car. If someone else approves, signs and pays for the same car and dates first, we tell you and offer you another car or other dates.
', 'Your offer', 'Read the confirmed price, then approve, ask for a change or decline.',
