  '<p class="gd-p">Our offer is the confirmed price for your car and dates, with every fee and HST. It stays open for 24 hours. You approve it, ask for a change or decline it.</p><section class="gd-task" id="your-offer-open-your-offer" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Open your offer</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">We email you when the offer is ready. Sign in at <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/sign-in</span> and open <b class="gd-ui">Trips</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Your next trip is at the top, with a photo of the car and its next step. Press <b class="gd-ui">Review offer</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/760"><img src="/guides/img/renter-02-trips-offer-desktop-27603c14.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="760"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:4.5%;top:27%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:11.5%;top:70%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="your-offer-approve-ask-for-a-change-or-decline" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Approve, ask for a change, or decline</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Check the price, the dates, the place and any message from our team. The black bar shows how long the offer stays open.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">All good? Press <b class="gd-ui">Approve and continue</b> to sign and pay. No licence on file yet? The button says <b class="gd-ui">Upload your licence to accept</b>: upload it, then come back.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Want something different? Press <b class="gd-ui">Ask for a change</b>, write what you need, then <b class="gd-ui">Send request</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Not going ahead? Press <b class="gd-ui">Decline offer</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Decline this offer</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10003/offer</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/902"><img src="/guides/img/renter-03-offer-desktop-cae88b00.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="902"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:86.1%;top:12%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:70.8%;top:50.9%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:70.8%;top:58.1%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:77.1%;top:64.5%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>This offer does not hold the car. If someone else approves, signs and pays for the same car and dates first, we tell you and offer you another car or other dates.</div></aside></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('renter', 'sign-and-pay', 'chapter', 'your-offer', 'After you approve, you sign the rental agreement on screen and pay. It takes a few minutes on a phone or a computer; the signing itself is three taps.

## Sign the rental agreement

1. Fill in your home address and licence details. You do this once; we keep them for next time.
2. Press **Save details**. The agreement then shows your details.

![](/guides/img/renter-04-sign-details-desktop-bd193670.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1052; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10057/sign; pins: 1 44.4 25.9, 2 16.3 96.4")

3. Check the key values at the top: the car, the dates, the deposit and the deductible. Open **Read the full rental agreement** to read it word for word, or press **Download PDF** to keep a copy. Below it is the Blind Spot Car Rental agreement, filled in with the same booking: we rent under Blind Spot''s insurance, so it is part of your rental too. Press its **Download PDF** to read it.
4. Under Sign, tap **All four**: it ticks the four statements, which stay on screen to read.
5. Confirm it is you: press **Send the code** and type the 6-digit code we text (or email) you. Tick that you read the agreements, initial each key term in its box, tick the three consents and draw your signature with your finger or the mouse.
6. Press **Sign and continue to payment**. Your one signature signs both agreements; the signed copies, with a certificate of each step, are in Documents and in the email that confirms your booking.

![](/guides/img/renter-06-sign-ready-desktop-1eee20a4.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1212; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10057/sign; pins: 3 59.0 8.9, 4 69.4 18.2, 5 90.3 78.5, 6 96.9 87.1")

## Signing with our staff

At pickup or at our desk, you can sign on a CarmaCars phone or tablet.

1. Our staff member checks your name and your original licence, then hands you the device.
2. Read the agreements, confirm the code we text you, initial the key terms, tick the consents and sign with your finger. Then hand the device back.
3. It is the same signature as signing online. Prefer your own phone? Ask for the signing link by email or text.

## When your booking changes after you sign

Your agreements always match your booking.

1. If the dates, the price, the car, the drivers or your coverage change, you get an email and a text with a link to the new version: read what changed and sign it the same way. Until you sign, the earlier version applies.
2. A correction that changes nothing you agreed to (a typo in an address) comes as a corrected copy by email, with nothing to sign.
3. At pickup and at return you get your agreements as picked up and as returned: the time, kilometres and fuel, and at return the final charges.

## Pay to confirm

1. Check What you pay now. The refundable deposit is taken at pickup, not today.
2. Enter the Name on the card and the card details. Use a credit card in your own name.
3. Press **Pay $...** (the button shows the amount).

![](/guides/img/renter-07-pay-desktop-705896d6.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 1082; address: carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10057/pay; pins: 7 70.5 21.9, 8 64.6 16.5, 9 64.6 96.4")

