n><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-sign-an-updated-vehicle-schedule" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sign an updated Vehicle Schedule</h2><p class="gd-p">When we agree new terms for a car you already signed for, you sign an updated Vehicle Schedule. Home shows it first.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open it from Home or the email. It shows what changes (now and updated) and the date it applies from.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Read the text, tick that you agree, type your full legal name and press <b class="gd-ui">Sign</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Your current terms stay until you sign. After that, your invoices and statements use the new ones from the date.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-form-c-on-screen-with-your-witness-beside-you" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Form C on screen, with your witness beside you</h2><p class="gd-p">Form C is the lender or lessor permission for a financed or leased car. It needs one witness, and you can sign it on screen when your witness is with you.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Documents. Under Forms to sign with witnesses, press Sign Form C on screen instead.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Initial each of the three acknowledgments, and type Your initials.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Sign: draw your signature in the box, or use your name.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Hand the device to your witness, another adult. They type their full name and tick the statement &quot;I witnessed (your name) sign in my presence.&quot; Press <b class="gd-ui">Sign Form C</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/documents/form-c/4898eb96-0cce-4efc-9fdd-740b4b4e9ad3</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:790/980"><img src="/guides/img/owner-16-form-c-screen-desktop-faa92983.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="790" height="980"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:5.7%;top:13.6%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:32.9%;top:55.1%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:6.3%;top:82.2%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-forms-c-and-d-on-paper-signed-with-witnesses" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Forms C and D on paper, signed with witnesses</h2><p class="gd-p">Form D is a limited power of attorney (two witnesses), signed on paper. Form C can be signed on paper too, with one witness.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Documents. Under Forms to sign with witnesses, press <b class="gd-ui">Print the form</b>. It is filled in, and every spot to sign or initial is marked SIGN HERE or INITIAL HERE.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Sign it in front of your witnesses. They sign and print their names in their spots.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Type each witness&#39;s full name in the boxes.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">On your phone, press <b class="gd-ui">Take a photo of the signed page</b>: one photo of each page. A PDF scan works too (<b class="gd-ui">Or choose a file</b>).</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/documents</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/742"><img src="/guides/img/owner-12-forms-c-d-desktop-21fbbe79.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="742"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:21.5%;top:32.5%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:69.4%;top:50.7%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:69.4%;top:60.4%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>We check the photo and approve it, or send it back with what to fix. You get an email either way, and the page shows the status.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Why paper for Form D? It is a power of attorney, which cannot be signed electronically in Ontario, and its two witnesses sign in person.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="documents-and-forms-government-forms-filled-for-you" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Government forms filled for you</h2><p class="gd-p">Each car&#39;s registry forms are prepared from your records. Until we load the official PDF, you get a data sheet with the values.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Documents and choose a form marked &quot;Official form, filled for you&quot;.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Download the filled form</b> and check each value.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Print it and sign it in ink. It is the official ServiceOntario form exactly as ServiceOntario publishes it, with only its empty text boxes filled in. Its boxes to tick and its signatures are done by hand, at the registry office or before you go, as we tell you.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/documents/forms/4d54a524-c28d-4bc4-8ad3-dd9558100a81/official</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/732"><img src="/guides/img/owner-13-official-form-desktop-48614913.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="732"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:22.2%;top:29.5%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>ON00453 (a company&#39;s registrant number) is an Adobe form: open it in Adobe Acrobat Reader (free) to see and print it. Other PDF viewers show a blank page, as they do with the form downloaded from ServiceOntario.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>Official registry forms are never signed on screen. You pay ServiceOntario, the inspection station and the appraiser directly.</div></aside></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('admin', 'getting-around-admin', 'chapter', 'start-here', 'Admin opens on To do: the day''s counts at the top, then what needs you now, most urgent first. The menu groups every screen into seven groups: Today, Bookings, Cars, People, Marketing, Money and Settings. The long groups come in labelled parts (for example People: Owners and partners, then Renters, staff and investors). Search finds any booking, car or person, and Ctrl+K jumps to any page.

## To do

Start every shift here. Each line says what to do and why, and its button opens a small pop-up that does it, already filled in. Nothing to remember and no menu to search.

1. Each piece of work is its own line (work of one kind for several cars is one line, such as Add real photos (72 cars); its button opens the list), marked Now, Today or When you can: a car the insurer has not confirmed, a car not on the site, a renter''s documents to check, a visitor waiting in live chat, a booking request, a change a renter asked for, an owner application, an owner invoice waiting for payment, the first and last month an owner paid after their invoices were voided, the terms agreed with an owner still on the standard grid, documents an owner has not signed, an official form to check, a plate to check, a car showing sample photos, and any task of the Admin.
2. Press the line''s button: Mark insured, Set rates and publish, Review documents, Record payment, Record what they paid, Enter the terms, Record paper signature, Checked: use for owners, Open the chat, and so on. A line you do not need has Not needed or These are correct. The pop-up is filled in; check it and confirm. The line disappears once the work is done.
3. Under the lines, the counts with one button each (failed payments, agreements to countersign, tolls, listings, insurance, staff commissions, prices typed by hand, sales claims, Turo emails). A count with nothing waiting moves to the bottom, under "more with nothing waiting".
4. While no assistant holds customer service, sales, finance or fleet (the live verification''s test accounts do not count), their tasks come to To do too, and so do their emails, to rent@carmacars.ca.
5. Beside the list (under it on a phone): today''s pickups (ready or not ready), today''s returns (due or late) and today''s chauffeur bookings, by time.
6. Press **Overview** for the money, fleet and queue figures, the alerts and the team''s sales for the month.
7. The dark band at the top counts the day, each count one tap from its page: requests waiting (with how long the oldest has waited, red past the reply target), pickups and returns today, payments to chase, deposits to settle, staff tasks open and alerts. A count that needs you now is red and says so.

![](/guides/img/admin-01-today-desktop-ea48309c.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 900; address: carmacars.ca/admin; pins: 1 22.6 31.6, 2 90.3 31.7, 3 18.4 90.2, 4 94.4 22.2")

## The menu

The current group is open, with its pages; press another group to open it. On a phone the whole menu sits behind one Menu button that says where you are.

| Group | Pages |
| --- | --- |
| Today | To do, Overview, Staff tasks, Live visitors |
| Bookings | Trips: Requests, Bookings, Calendar, Add a rental, Chauffeur. Customers: Live chat, Renter leads, Reviews. Problems: Damage, Incidents and claims |
| Cars | Vehicles, Listings, Maintenance, Rates for many cars, Calendar sync, Similar cars, Retire or delete |
| Money | Owners: Owner invoices, Owner debits, Owner statements, Payouts. Renters: Payments by day, Payments and refunds, Tolls and tickets. Company: Company statements, Reconciliation, Expenses, Insurer rates, Insurer invoices, Staff commissions, Field pay |
| People | Owners and partners: Applications, Owners, Add a car for an owner, Partners, Owner forms, Paid and signed. Renters, staff and investors: Renters, Staff, Investors, Portals and view as |
| Marketing | Ads: Listings, Posted ads, Social drafts. Results: Bookings by channel. Owners: Owner recruitment |
| Settings | All settings. Website: Site, Vehicle pages, Sample photos, Add-ons, Discount games, Guides. Rules: Program, Forms, Maintenance, Emails. Records: Email log, Audit log |

![On a phone: press Menu (1), then a group (2), then the page (3).](/guides/img/admin-31-menu-phone-667dc2fd.jpg "phone; size: 390 715; pins: 1 10.3 28.7, 2 76.9 42.4, 3 76.9 48.3")

## Search

The search box sits at the top of the menu, on every page.

1. Type a booking number (CC-1042), a car code (CC-7F3A, on every car page and fleet card), a plate, a VIN, or a name or email address.
2. Press **Search** (or Enter). Results come in groups: bookings, cars, owners, partners and renters. Open one to go to its page.
3. To go to a page instead, press Ctrl+K (Cmd+K on a Mac) or **Jump to a page** under the search box, type a few letters (Payouts, Program settings) and press Enter. The first line searches the records for what you typed.

![](/guides/img/admin-32-search-desktop-ca548a70.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 420; address: carmacars.ca/admin/search?q=CC-10057; pins: 1 7.4 45.2, 2 95.0 46.9")

## Keyboard shortcuts

Press g, then a letter. Press / to jump to the search box, and Ctrl+K to jump to any page.

| Keys | Opens | Keys | Opens |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| g t | To do | g v | Vehicles |
| g r | Requests | g l | Listings |
| g b | Bookings | g a | Applications |
| g c | Calendar | g o | Owners |
| g k | Staff tasks | g m | Payments and refunds |
| g s | All settings | / | Search |
| Ctrl K | Jump to a page | Esc | Close it |
