![](/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-f05000e2.jpg "phone; size: 390 920; pins: 2 92.3 78.3")

## Sign in with your phone number

Quicker on a phone than a password: a 6-digit code by text.

1. On **Profile**, under Sign-in, press **Add and verify my phone number**, enter your mobile number and press **Text me a code**.
2. Type the code from the text (it usually fills itself in) and press **Verify**. Choose **My phone number (a code by text)** under Sign in with.
3. Next time, the sign-in page opens on your phone number: press **Text me a code** and enter the code. Two-step sign-in still asks for your authenticator code.

## Texts or email

On **Profile**, under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both** for the messages we send you. Texts need the phone you verified above.
',
  '<p class="gd-p">Report anything that happens on the road, add a rental for a renter you found, share your referral link, and keep your details up to date.</p><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-report-a-problem" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Report a problem</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Report a problem</b> and choose the Car.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Choose What happened: <b class="gd-ui">New damage found</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Warning light</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Collision while I was driving</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Ticket or toll while I was driving</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Lost property found</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Something else</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Write the Details: where, when and what you see.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Take a photo</b> for each photo, then <b class="gd-ui">Send the report</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/1040"><img src="/guides/img/field-03-report-phone-3b903b20.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="1040"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:93.6%;top:46.6%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:93.6%;top:64.9%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:93.6%;top:89.9%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>In a collision, make sure everyone is safe and call 911 if anyone is hurt. Then call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991 before you send the report.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-add-a-rental-for-a-renter-you-found" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Add a rental for a renter you found</h2><p class="gd-p">Your home address must be in your profile first: until it is, the page asks for it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Add a rental</b>. Choose the car, the dates and the places, then type the renter&#39;s details. A renter already on file is found by their email. Car already out with the renter? Enter the pickup as when it left: it is recorded as on trip.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Check the calendar and the price</b>. To charge another price, type it with the reason: a price far under the rate sheet is flagged for an Admin, not refused.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Choose <b class="gd-ui">Send a payment link</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Charge the saved card when the renter signs</b>. The renter pays online: you take no payment for it yourself.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Under Who found this client, choose <b class="gd-ui">I sourced this client</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Entered for CarmaCars</b>, then press <b class="gd-ui">Add the rental</b>.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-commissions" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Commissions</h2><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">You earn 10% of the rental charge (before tax, after discounts, less refunds) of each rental you sourced: one you added and marked I sourced this client, or a booking made with your referral link.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">It is earned when the rental is completed and paid in full, then an Admin approves it and it is paid on your pay date. Your home address must be in your profile: until it is, a commission waits as not earned yet.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">My sales</b> shows each commission: not earned yet, pending approval, approved, paid or reversed. A refund after payment comes off a later commission.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-referrals-and-profile" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Referrals and profile</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Referrals</b>: your own referral link. Press <b class="gd-ui">Copy the link</b>, or let someone scan its QR code. A booking made with it counts as a rental you sourced.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>: <b class="gd-ui">Save my phone</b>, your home address (<b class="gd-ui">Change my home address</b>), <b class="gd-ui">Set up two-step sign-in</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Change my password</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Sign out</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/920"><img src="/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-f05000e2.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="920"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.3%;top:78.3%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-sign-in-with-your-phone-number" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sign in with your phone number</h2><p class="gd-p">Quicker on a phone than a password: a 6-digit code by text.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, under Sign-in, press <b class="gd-ui">Add and verify my phone number</b>, enter your mobile number and press <b class="gd-ui">Text me a code</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Type the code from the text (it usually fills itself in) and press <b class="gd-ui">Verify</b>. Choose <b class="gd-ui">My phone number (a code by text)</b> under Sign in with.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Next time, the sign-in page opens on your phone number: press <b class="gd-ui">Text me a code</b> and enter the code. Two-step sign-in still asks for your authenticator code.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-texts-or-email" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Texts or email</h2><p class="gd-p">On <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, under <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b>, choose <b class="gd-ui">Email</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Text</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Both</b> for the messages we send you. Texts need the phone you verified above.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('investor', 'your-investments', 'chapter', 'start-here', 'Investments shows each of your investments: what you put in, what it earns, and when it pays.

## Read an investment

1. The tabs: **Investments**, **Statements**, **Documents to sign**, **Investor deck** (while CarmaCars shares it) and **Profile and notices**. **Guide** and **Sign out** are at the top.
2. Your agreement number and name, your Invested Amount, the Returns paid to date (or reinvested) and the next payment, with a chart of your account month by month.
3. Each investment: its Invested Amount, how far the lockup period has run, the Yearly Percentage, how Returns are handled (Paid monthly or Reinvested) and the Next Payment Date. Principal, what was reinvested and redeemed to date, the Investment Date and the Lockup End Date are under "Principal, dates and amounts to date".
4. Payment schedule: the last Returns on your statements and the next ones. An amount that is not on a statement yet is marked Estimated.
5. Latest statement, with **Open**.

![](/guides/img/investor-01-investments-phone-d7251016.jpg "phone; size: 390 795; pins: 1 97.0 14.5, 2 76.9 28.3, 3 92.3 37.1, 4 92.3 71.7, 5 92.3 96.2")

> Tip: This area shows your records under your Investment Agreement. It is not an offer or a solicitation.

## Sign your investment agreement

When CarmaCars sends your agreement, it is under Documents to sign.

1. Press **Documents to sign** in the menu. The top shows what is signed ("0 of 1 signed").
2. Check the key values: your name and address, the Invested Amount, the Yearly Percentage and the dates. The agreement is filled in from your record.
3. Press **Read the PDF** and read it, with its schedules.
4. Say whether you got independent legal advice, and tick the risk acknowledgment (Schedule C). Your initials are filled in.
5. Press **Sign**. Your full legal name is your signature (or press **Draw instead**). The signed copy is on the same page.

Once you sign, the agreement shows "Awaiting countersignature by CarmaCars" under Signed. CarmaCars''s signing officer countersigns it; the agreement binds CarmaCars once it is countersigned and your funds have cleared. You get the countersigned copy on the same page.

> Tip: Signed on paper instead? Once we record it, it shows under Signed with the scan.
