nth pays, what is paid to you for the period, and your Invested Amount at the end, with a chart and a month-by-month table.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">The calculator follows your agreement exactly: no Return for the lockup, then one twelfth of the Yearly Percentage on the Invested Amount each month, by days for a part month, paid on the 15th of the next month or added to the Invested Amount at month end.</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>The examples use the yearly percentage of our current offer. Your own percentage is the one in your agreement. Every example and figure in the deck is an illustration, not a forecast or a promise, and is not part of any offering memorandum.</div></aside></section>');
